### ============================================================
### NoCap Eats — Delivery Service Manual Tests
### Base: http://localhost:5203  (or via gateway :5000)
### Prerequisite: Order must be in ReadyForPickup state
###   - orderId from Order tests (step 3c completed)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5203

# Paste DeliveryAgent token from Identity tests:
@agentToken = PASTE_AGENT_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

# ── 1. Browse available deliveries ────────────────────────────

### 1a. List pending deliveries → 200 (should show 1 after order placed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Store the delivery ID from response:
@deliveryId = PASTE_DELIVERY_ID_HERE

### 1b. No token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/pending

### 1c. Wrong role (use customer token) → 403
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/pending
# Authorization: Bearer CUSTOMER_TOKEN_HERE

# ── 2. My deliveries ──────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Agent's deliveries — empty before accepting → 200 []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/my
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

# ── 3. Accept a delivery ──────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. Accept → 200 (status: Assigned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### 3b. Accept same delivery again → 409 Conflict (already assigned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### 3c. My deliveries now → 200 [1 delivery, Assigned]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/my
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

# ── 4. Drive delivery to completion ──────────────────────────

### 4a. Mark picked up (Assigned → PickedUp) → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

{
  "status": 2
}

### 4b. Invalid transition (PickedUp → Assigned) → 409 Conflict
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

{
  "status": 1
}

### 4c. Mark delivered (PickedUp → Delivered) → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

{
  "status": 3
}

### 4d. Verify final state → 200 (status: Delivered, deliveredAt not null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/my
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

# ── 5. Failed delivery scenario ───────────────────────────────

### 5a. (After placing another order) Accept new delivery
### 5b. Mark as Failed → 200
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/NEW_DELIVERY_ID/status
# Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
#
# {
#   "status": 4
# }
